        "content": [
          "To start the process",
          "begin by supplying the requirement and then documenting it",
          "If the order is received",
          "via fax, input the order into an Excel file",
          "Once the Excel list is complete",
          "send it to the student.",
          "Upon receiving the Excel list",
          "type the orders into the MS-Access database.",
          "ensure that it is completed",
          "control the incoming order",
          "If the order is correct",
          "release it",
          "Send the Excel list to the student and upon receiving it, continue with the process.",
          "If the order is worth",
          "less than 5.000 \u20ac",
          "release the order",
          "Once the order is received by PPC, they will initiate production.",
          "After PPC initiates production, the goods will be produced.",
          "If not",
          "check the quality of the goods.",
          "create and send a quality report to the finance department.",
          "Release the order via memo and ensure that the memo is achieved in the warehouse.",
          "Send the invoice",
          "report the achievement to the finance department.",
          "ensure that the signed memo is achieved in the logistic department.",
          "Finally, archive the memo",
          "close the order.",
          "This marks the end of the process."
        ]
      },
